  "title": "对新华社的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-069.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>069)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　你们新华社只有几千人，太少了，恐怕是世界通迅社中最小的吧！可以办得更大一些。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/1-068.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-070.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
